(7559401, 1211797, 28742, '<td valign="top">He stuck his nose in where it didn''t belong. Uncovered evidence of high level corruption and threatened to blow the lid off of their whole operation. Did he think they would just sit back and wait for the indictments? Was he that naive? The final question: was he clever enough to have an insurance policy - a dead man''s switch, so to speak?<br/> <br/>...on the other hand, maybe he was just overworked and died of cardiac arrest.</td>', 'He stuck his nose in where it didn''t belong. Uncovered evidence of high level corruption and threatened to blow the lid off of their whole operation. Did he think they would just sit back and wait for the indictments? Was he that naive? The final question: was he clever enough to have an insurance policy - a dead man''s switch, so to speak? ...on the other hand, maybe he was just overworked and died of cardiac arrest.', '2018-02-14 13:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
